;;;;                       d enters holding (f,e,b,a) in lanes 0..3
;;;;                       s enters holding (h,g,d,c) in lanes 0..3
;;;;                       and d leaves holding the new (f,e,b,a)
;;;;
;;;; G(g) holds the schedule words W[4g .. 4g+3].  Given G(0..3) from the
;;;; block, for g = 4..15:
